{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14ColoringModule0A0V","text":"Coloring","identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/Coloring"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"First fit in index order (the lexicographically first proper colouring of all) when it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already optimal. Otherwise each vertex in turn takes the least colour its prefix still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extends with (k-colouring’s self-reduction to its decision problem): a Kempe swap of the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colouring found when one avoids the prefix, else DSatur branch and bound over the parts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after the prefix that the vertex touches (on sparse components with conflict-directed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backjumping and restarts). Khuller and Vazirani show the lexicographically first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"four-colouring of a planar graph is NP-hard to find, though some four-colouring is found in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polynomial time. It can be far slower than "},{"code":"minimumColoring()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": on random sparse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3-colourable graphs with 2n edges it took about 0.2 s at 1,000 vertices, 2.7 s at 2,000 and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over 100 s at 5,000, where "},{"code":"minimumColoring()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" takes about a millisecond. The search does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"check for task cancellation."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P14ColoringModuleE029lexicographicallyFirstMinimumC0AD0C0VyxGyF","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ExactColoring.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ColoringModule\/ExactColoring.swift#L659"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14ColoringModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Coloring"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","role":"symbol","title":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()","modules":[{"name":"ColoringModule","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/coloringmodule\/graphprotocols\/graph\/lexicographicallyfirstminimumcoloring()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The lexicographically first minimum colouring of the simple graph: on each connected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component, of all its colourings with its own chromatic number of colours, the one whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colour vector (in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order) is lexicographically least, Khuller and Vazirani’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lexicographically first k-colouring (1991) with k = the component’s χ. So within a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component colours appear in order of first use, colour classes are numbered by their least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex, a bipartite component is coloured by its "},{"code":"bipartition()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sides (left 0), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"colorCount == chromaticNumber()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Components are not coupled: a bipartite one keeps two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colours beside a triangle."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule/GraphProtocols":{"title":"GraphProtocols","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/coloringmodule\/graphprotocols","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols"},"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule/GraphProtocols/Graph/lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()":{"title":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()","url":"\/documentation\/coloringmodule\/graphprotocols\/graph\/lexicographicallyfirstminimumcoloring()","abstract":[{"text":"The lexicographically first minimum colouring of the simple graph: on each connected","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component, of all its colourings with its own chromatic number of colours, the one whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"colour vector (in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order) is lexicographically least, Khuller and Vazirani’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lexicographically first k-colouring (1991) with k = the component’s χ. So within a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component colours appear in order of first use, colour classes are numbered by their least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex, a bipartite component is coloured by its ","type":"text"},{"code":"bipartition()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sides (left 0), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"colorCount == chromaticNumber()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Components are not coupled: a bipartite one keeps two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"colours beside a triangle.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Coloring","preciseIdentifier":"s:14ColoringModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule/Coloring":{"title":"Coloring","url":"\/documentation\/coloringmodule\/coloring","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A proper colouring of a graph’s vertices by the colours "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<colorCount"},{"type":"text","text":", each of which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used (unless preset colours skip some): the result of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:presetColor:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(order:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"minimumColoring()"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumColoring()"},{"type":"text","text":" (JGraphT "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VertexColoringAlgorithm.Coloring"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Graphs.jl "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Coloring"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/Coloring","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Coloring","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Coloring","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule":{"title":"ColoringModule","url":"\/documentation\/coloringmodule","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule/GraphProtocols/Graph":{"url":"\/documentation\/coloringmodule\/graphprotocols\/graph","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Graph","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Graph"}}}